<Page title="Privacy · SecureLab">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>
    SecureLab stores lesson progress in IndexedDB and offline site files in your
    browser cache. The app sends no answers or progress to a server. Hosting
    providers process ordinary requests for site files.
  </p><p>
    Use the <a href="/progress/">progress page</a> to export or erase your learning
    records. Browser site settings can also clear the cached files and progress. Storage
    applies to the current website address and browser.
  </p>
</Page>
